{"seq":2,"slug":"deep-learning","title":"深度学习推荐","docCount":3,"url":"/h/data-science/recommendation-algorithms/deep-learning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"embedding-neural-cf","title":"Embedding 与神经协同过滤","url":"/h/data-science/recommendation-algorithms/deep-learning/embedding-neural-cf","wordCount":1233,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"sequential-recommendation","title":"序列推荐模型","url":"/h/data-science/recommendation-algorithms/deep-learning/sequential-recommendation","wordCount":1253,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"graph-based-recommendation","title":"图推荐模型","url":"/h/data-science/recommendation-algorithms/deep-learning/graph-based-recommendation","wordCount":1252,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 深度学习推荐\n\n本章进入推荐系统的深度学习时代。从 2016 年 YouTube DNN 到 2025 年的生成式推荐，深度模型在表示学习能力、序列建模精度和关系图谱利用上持续突破传统方法的天花板。\n\n三篇文档分别覆盖 Embedding 与神经协同过滤（将用户/物品映射到稠密向量空间）、序列推荐（捕捉用户兴趣的时间演化）、图推荐（利用用户-物品交互图的高阶结构信息）。掌握这三条技术脉络后，读者将具备理解工业级推荐模型架构的完整知识基础。\n"}